<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43916" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐήνεμ-ος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐάν-</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> [ᾱ</span>, exc. in <i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			9.555
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Crin.
		</span></i>)], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>well as to the winds</i>, i.e., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>serene, calm</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόντου χεῦμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					316
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλόος εὐ</span>. a <i>fair</i>
			voyage, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				28.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> epith. of
			Zeus at Sparta, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				3.13.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sheltered from the wind</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιμένες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					749
				</span></i>
			 (and perh. also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίμνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					371
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.)); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Abd.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>open to the wind</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς πῦρ] ἐν
				εὐανέμοις βάσσαις</span> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔπνοος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				197
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				9.20.1
			</span></i>.</div>
